OL,3,ALindsay Clancy appears in court as her
OL,4,Alawyer pushes for murder case to be
OL,5,Adismissed
OL,6,
OL,7,FWarning: This story contains
OL,8,Fdistressing details and discussion of
OL,9,Fattempted suicide
OL,11,FLindsay Clancy, the US woman accused of
OL,12,Fmurdering her three children, has
OL,13,Fappeared in court for the first time
OL,14,Fsince her murder trial fell apart
OL,15,Fearlier this month.
OL,17,FHer defence team on Tuesday argued the
OL,18,Fjudge should dismiss her case but
OL,19,Fprosecutors said the state had "met its
OL,20,Fburden" in proving her guilt.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
