OL,3,ALindsay Clancy appears in court as her
OL,4,Alawyer pushes for murder case to be
OL,5,Adismissed
OL,6,
OL,7,FClancy, 36, does not deny killing her
OL,8,Fthree children in 2023, but her defence
OL,9,Fteam argues she was suffering from
OL,10,Fsevere postpartum psychosis at the
OL,11,Ftime. Prosecutors say the killings were
OL,12,Fintentional.
